# ==============================================================================
# Axel Firejail Local Override Configuration (~/.config/firejail/axel.local)
# ==============================================================================

# --- Fix Abstract X11 Socket Error on Wayland/XWayland ---
# By default, axel.profile specifies "x11 none". On Wayland/XWayland systems where
# abstract X11 sockets exist in the network namespace (@/tmp/.X11-unix/X0), Firejail
# throws a fatal error refusing to run.
# Ignoring the x11 rule stops Firejail from checking abstract X11 sockets, allowing
# axel to run smoothly while keeping filesystem isolation (protecting your SSH keys and vaults).
ignore x11
